# Single-page app fallback (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages).
#
# Every route below "/" is rendered by react-router in the browser, so the host
# must serve index.html for paths that have no file behind them. Without this,
# https://vooolabs.com/products returns a 404 -- and sitemap.xml hands that
# exact URL to Google to crawl.
/*    /index.html   200
